flowchart TD
  Task[Research task] --> Plan[Query planning]
  Plan --> Search[Search adapters]
  Search --> Normalize[Normalize and deduplicate]
  Normalize --> Guard[URL / SSRF policy]
  Guard --> Fetch[Fetch and extract]
  Fetch --> Provenance[Store source metadata and locators]
  Provenance --> Claims[Extract claims and evidence]
  Claims --> Verify[Cross-check / conflict detection]
  Verify --> Report[Report with claim-level citations]
  Report --> Review{Evidence sufficient?}
  Review -->|No| Plan
  Review -->|Yes| Done[Complete with limitations]
